    (CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma1 M ⊓ CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma0 p) inf_le_left le_rfl L ζ hζ K₁ hK₁' A hAp hζA
    j hj ϖ hϖ W₀ hW₀ hSW₀ y hyϖ hy𝔓 hy₀ R hRmem

